{
  "name": "item_stack_sizes",
  "description": "Item entities stack only as high as their item does. Ender pearls of 10, 6 and 10 lie side by side: when they look for neighbours to merge with, the first takes in the 6 to make 16, and the last 10 stays apart because 26 would be more than a stack of pearls. Two more stacks of 10 pearls never merge, as 20 would be too many, and two diamond pickaxes never merge. A hopper holding 10 pearls picks up 10 more, which fill its first slot to 16 and put 4 in the next, and a hopper minecart under a chest takes 20 pearls into two slots.",
